                <pb facs="0570" n="530" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v05/pg530"/>

                <head>165. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>Between January 20 and 23, President Arturo Frondizi, accompanied by senior
                    Argentine officials, paid a State visit to the United States. President Frondizi
                    had conversations with President Eisenhower, Secretary Dulles, and other
                    administration officials. During his visit, Frondizi addressed a joint meeting
                    of Congress. For text of the address, see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, February 23, 1959, pages 280–283.</p>
            </div>
